abstract: "Momentum First is a pre-1.0 theoretical manuscript exploring a momentum-centered framework for foundations, gravity, quantum mechanics, and cosmology. It develops Additive Directional Momentum Conservation, directional shell readings, gravity and quantum dynamics under stated assumptions, a stage-dressing account of cosmological expansion, and an introductory geometric picture of internal cycles in Part 0."
